notes.content:
Changes:
[list]
[*] Fixed a crash for players who completed several expeditions;
[*] Some achievements have been fixed (if you have previously fulfilled the conditions for obtaining them, you will unlock them automatically);
[*] Added new achievements;
[*] Added the ability to change the reward for the level. It can be purchased on the main planet after purchasing Unique Rewards;
[*] Added Danish translation (not final).
[/list]
